    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BDA201 · Assessment 1/6</span>\n<h2>Group ASM</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14391 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BDA201 · Đầu điểm 1/6</span>\n<h2>Group ASM</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14391 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Entire trimester; presentations in Sessions 58-59</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Group project: dataset-based analysis, report/slides, presentation, and Q&amp;A using rubric criteria</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1 group project; no MCQs</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">End-to-end business analytics project: problem framing; data preparation; descriptive/visual analysis; one suitable introductory predictive or prescriptive method; limitations; evidence-based recommendation. Groups may use Excel, Python, or R where feasible, but advanced data-mining methods and complex coding are optional/awareness-level only and should not be required.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Groups complete a guided project using an approved dataset and present findings. The project should demonstrate usable business reasoning, clear communication, and explainable tool/method choices rather than technical complexity. Any Excel/Python/R outputs used must be interpreted in non-technical business language.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Introduced in Session 3, checked around Session 42, finalized around Session 54, and presented in Sessions 58-59. Recommend keeping supporting materials to a project brief, rubric, and presentation guidance only.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 57 — 19. Integrated review and final exam preparation</li><li>Session 58 — 20. Group presentations and course wrap-up</li><li>Session 59 — 20. Group presentations and course wrap-up</li><li>Session 60 — 20. Group presentations and course wrap-up</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 57 — 19. Integrated review and final exam preparation</li><li>Buổi 58 — 20. Group presentations and course wrap-up</li><li>Buổi 59 — 20. Group presentations and course wrap-up</li><li>Buổi 60 — 20. Group presentations and course wrap-up</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
